# {{ app_name }} - Spring Boot (Kotlin)

## Stack
- Spring Boot {{ versions.spring_boot }}, Kotlin {{ versions.kotlin }}, Java {{ versions.java }}, Gradle {{ versions.gradle }}
- Jackson 3.x, JUnit Jupiter 6
- Hosting is the project owner's choice (see the `deployment` skill, `.agents/skills/deployment/SKILL.md`)

## Structure
```
{{ app_path }}/src/main/kotlin/{{ app_package_path }}/
  modules/<domain>/  -> controller/, dto/, error/, model/, repository/, service/
```

## Patterns
- Controller -> Service -> Repository -> Entity
- DTOs in `dto/` package, entities in `model/` - never expose entities
- Tests use MockK for service logic and `@SpringBootTest` with MockMvc for request-path behavior

## Commands
- `./gradlew bootRun` or `task {{ app_id }}:run` (port {{ port }})
- `./gradlew test` or `task {{ app_id }}:test`
- `./gradlew build -x test` or `task {{ app_id }}:build`
